{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y压缩了部分人物动机和心理转折，例如S04想通过表达留住当下的好、S07对对方是否需要自己的谨慎猜测，X交代得更完整；Y个别地方还把含蓄的猜想说得偏确定。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句、重点加亮和话语与感受交替，让普通观众更容易在听音乐时抓住人物每一阶段的核心变化；感受又有具体的音色、节奏、身体感觉和水波意象，并通过到时出现的安排与音乐进程结合，细腻度和前后呼应都更好。X的优势是人物动机交代得更充分，尤其是害怕失去亲近、因此收住表达的因果关系，但长句与右侧碎片并置，观众需要自行整合的信息更多。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa450cc1-0dae-4a36-9676-c9fe31551493", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T062633072360Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T06:27:49.344344+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "82c882872ecc3a475e360ea546613609d4554de26e6ac9f6bc910d1a38c923ce", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w